---
import Simple from "../layouts/Simple.astro";
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from "../links.ts";
---

<Simple
  title="Privacy"
  eyebrow="Privacy"
  heading="What this site keeps about you"
  lead="Very little. There are no trackers, analytics, cookies or third-party scripts on composableos.dev."
  description="What composableos.dev stores when you ask for a call, and how to have it deleted."
>
  <div class="prose">
    <h2>The call form</h2>
    <p>
      When you ask for a call we store what you typed (your email address and, if you gave them,
      your name, company and message) and when you sent it. We use it to reply to you. We don't add
      you to a newsletter and we don't share it with anyone.
    </p>
    <h2>Requests to the site</h2>
    <p>
      The site runs on Cloudflare, which handles every request to it. To stop form spam we count
      submissions per IP address for a minute. We don't store your IP address with your request.
    </p>
    <h2>Deleting your details</h2>
    <p>
      Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> from the address you gave
      and we'll delete it.
    </p>
  </div>
</Simple>
